@startuml getApplicationNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getApplicationNameAsync – Retrieve HTTP Server Application Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Server Interface" as hsi #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  The requestor wants to retrieve the application name
end note

requestor -> hsi: (none)
activate hsi

hsi -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hsi: HTTP server LTP List
deactivate jd

note over hsi
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Access http-server-interface capability for each LTP  
  - Read application-name attribute  
  - Return the application name if found  
  - Return undefined if no application name exists
end note

hsi --> requestor: applicationName | undefined
deactivate hsi

@enduml
